{"id":"b3c39d743a421f30","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-omega-consistency-theorem.md","title":"Omega-consistency Theorem","display":"thm-omega-consistency-theorem — Omega-consistency Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-omega-consistency-theorem","aliases":["72-thm-omega-consistency-theorem"],"display":"thm-omega-consistency-theorem — Omega-consistency Theorem","depends_on":["[[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]","[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II §1.3.2, print95–98/PDF107–110; explicit standard Gödel construction","verification_status":"source-and-argument-reviewed","proof_status":"local incompleteness argument reviewed; coding implementation not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-omega-consistency-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-omega-consistency-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-consistency-theorem — Omega-consistency Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II §1.3.2, print95–98/PDF107–110; explicit standard Gödel construction"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local incompleteness argument reviewed; coding implementation not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-omega-consistency-theorem-—-Omega-consistency-theorem\">thm-omega-consistency-theorem — Omega-consistency-theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}\\)</span> 是有效公理化理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PA}^{\\rm PR}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathsf{PA}^{\\rm PR}\\subseteq T\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PA}^{\\rm PR}\">\\(\\mathsf{PA}^{\\rm PR}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a>。取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a> 的数语法模式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=1\">\\(\\iota=1\\)</span>、同一元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prf}_T,\\operatorname{Prov}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{Prf}_T,\\operatorname{Prov}_T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner A\\urcorner:=e_\\kappa(A)\">\\(\\ulcorner A\\urcorner:=e_\\kappa(A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_2^{(1)}\">\\(\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\)</span> 是逐行限制到数语法的可证性关系。</li>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:=x_0,p:=x_1\">\\(x:=x_0,p:=x_1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubCode}:=\\operatorname{SubCode}_{e_\\kappa}\">\\(\\operatorname{SubCode}:=\\operatorname{SubCode}_{e_\\kappa}\\)</span> 为上游明定坏码行为的数码代入函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{diag}(a):=\\operatorname{SubCode}(a,a)\">\\(\\operatorname{diag}(a):=\\operatorname{SubCode}(a,a)\\)</span>。依 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a>，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\">\\(c_\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(c_\\Delta)=1\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(c_\\Delta)=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ c_\\Delta⟧=\\operatorname{diag}\">\\(⟦ c_\\Delta⟧=\\operatorname{diag}\\)</span>，并记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_{\\rm diag}:=f_{c_\\Delta}\">\\(f_{\\rm diag}:=f_{c_\\Delta}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta(x):=\\forall p\\neg\\operatorname{Prf}_T(p,f_{\\rm diag}(x))\">\\(\\delta(x):=\\forall p\\neg\\operatorname{Prf}_T(p,f_{\\rm diag}(x))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:=\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner\">\\(d:=\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_T:=\\delta[\\overline d/x]\">\\(G_T:=\\delta[\\overline d/x]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:=\\ulcorner G_T\\urcorner=\\operatorname{diag}(d)\">\\(g:=\\ulcorner G_T\\urcorner=\\operatorname{diag}(d)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OneFree}\">\\(\\operatorname{OneFree}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^{0,\\rm PR}_1\">\\(\\Pi^{0,\\rm PR}_1\\)</span> 在Assertion中按实际数语法定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}\\)</span> 是相同数变量演算的元一致性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OneFree}:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E_{\\rm PR}):\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OneFree}:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E_{\\rm PR}):\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^{0,\\rm PR}_1:=\\{\\forall z_0\\cdots\\forall z_{k-1}B:k\\in\\omega,\\ \\vec z\\in V_N^k,\\ B\\in\\operatorname{QF}_1(E_{\\rm PR}),\\ \\operatorname{FV}(B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^{0,\\rm PR}_1:=\\{\\forall z_0\\cdots\\forall z_{k-1}B:k\\in\\omega,\\ \\vec z\\in V_N^k,\\ B\\in\\operatorname{QF}_1(E_{\\rm PR}),\\ \\operatorname{FV}(B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\operatorname{Con}(T):\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists A\\in\\operatorname{OneFree}\\ [(T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\exists x A)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\neg A[\\overline n/x])].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Omega\\operatorname{Con}(T):\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists A\\in\\operatorname{OneFree}\\ [(T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\exists x A)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\neg A[\\overline n/x])].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_T\\in\\Pi^{0,\\rm PR}_1,\\qquad T\\vdash_2^{(1)}[G_T\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Prov}_T(\\overline g)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_T\\in\\Pi^{0,\\rm PR}_1,\\qquad T\\vdash_2^{(1)}[G_T\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Prov}_T(\\overline g)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}(T)\\to T\\nvdash_2^{(1)}G_T,\\qquad\\Omega\\operatorname{Con}(T)\\to(T\\nvdash_2^{(1)}G_T\\land T\\nvdash_2^{(1)}\\neg G_T),\\qquad\\Omega\\operatorname{Con}(T)\\to\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}(T)\\to T\\nvdash_2^{(1)}G_T,\\qquad\\Omega\\operatorname{Con}(T)\\to(T\\nvdash_2^{(1)}G_T\\land T\\nvdash_2^{(1)}\\neg G_T),\\qquad\\Omega\\operatorname{Con}(T)\\to\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定程序的每个标准输入输出可在PA的PR定义扩展中验证，所以PA证明f_diag(d)=g。若T证明G，则该有限证明的数码p可被PA验证，T同时证明Prov(g)与其否定，违背一致性。若T证明¬G，则T证明∃pPrf(p,g)；一致性已排除任何实际G证明，因此每个标准n的检查为0，PA逐个证明¬Prf(n,g)，违背ω一致性。不一致理论对任意A都给这种矛盾组合，故ω一致性蕴含一致性。Π⁰₁语言约定原稿含糊，现明确为PR语言的Π⁰₁正规形；消去函数回到基本语言需标准Σ⁰₁计算表示，不能声称字面语法相同。对角算法与验证主链已说明，完整原始递归编码实现未机器验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-omega-consistency-theorem-—-Omega-consistency-theorem","text":"thm-omega-consistency-theorem — Omega-consistency-theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-arithmetized-proof","status":"resolved","id":"4c14656043bc77c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"r